DESCRIPTION:What is SketchUp and what can you do with it?\n\nSketchUp is a 
 3D design application designed for use in architecture and 3D asset design
 .\n\n \n\nCourse Description\n\nThis course will take students through an 
 overview of SketchUp using the Makerspace lab computers. Students will nee
 d to create a free account with SketchUp before the workshop using this li
 nk: https://id.trimble.com/ui/sign_in.html \n\n \n\nCourse Goals and Objec
 tives\n\nThe goal of the course is to have students develop and enrich the
 ir understanding of SketchUp to be able to create 3D models and sketches. 
 At the end of the course\, students will be able to:\n\nCreate and open Sk
 etchUp projects\,Design and Manipulate 3D assets in the SketchUp editor\,E
 xplore tools and functionalities within the software\,Understand Isometric
  angles and export appropriately framed snapshots.
